Description: Kernora OS applications
 The everyday applications of Kernora OS, drawn in its Material 3 design:
 .
  * Settings: network, Bluetooth, display, sound, notifications, wallpaper
    and style, apps, power, input devices, accessibility, privacy, the
    account, date and language, updates and information about the system;
  * Store: find, install, remove and update Flathub and Debian apps;
  * Files, Text Editor, Photos, Media Player, Calculator and Screenshot;
  * Task Manager: running apps, background processes and live usage of
    the processor, memory, graphics card, disk and network;
  * Android App Installer: installs Android apps from APK files;
  * Welcome, the first-run introduction;
  * the file chooser: every program's open and save dialogs, served to
    the session through the desktop portal.
  * update notifications: a message when updates are ready to install and
    when installed ones need a restart.
 .
 It also carries org.kernora.system, the Qt Quick module through which the
 applications read and change the system, and org.kernora.shell, which the
 desktop uses to open a widget's settings without leaving edit mode.

